<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Sample Projects on</title><link>https://wang-jian-an.github.io/categories/sample-projects/</link><description>Recent content in Sample Projects on</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 25 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://wang-jian-an.github.io/categories/sample-projects/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Demo: Markdown with Embedded HTML</title><link>https://wang-jian-an.github.io/slides/sample-projects/demo-embed/</link><pubDate>Tue, 25 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://wang-jian-an.github.io/slides/sample-projects/demo-embed/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="introduction"&gt;Introduction&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a sample page demonstrating how to write &lt;strong&gt;Markdown content&lt;/strong&gt; and embed interactive HTML pages from the &lt;code&gt;static/&lt;/code&gt; folder at the same time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can write normal Markdown here — headings, lists, code blocks, links, images — anything you like.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="embedded-slide-if-conditions"&gt;Embedded Slide: If Conditions&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Below is an interactive slide about &amp;ldquo;If Conditions&amp;rdquo; embedded directly into this Markdown page:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="embed-html-container" style="position: relative; width: 100%; margin: 1.5rem 0;"&gt;
&lt;div style="display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;"&gt;
&lt;button class="embed-fullscreen-btn" onclick="toggleEmbedFullscreen('embed-iframe-18da448c1fc5fbac49d356be820ac974')" aria-label="全螢幕切換" style="background: #4a5568; color: #fff; border: none; border-radius: 6px; padding: 8px 14px; font-size: 0.85rem; cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; transition: background 0.2s;"&gt;
&lt;svg class="embed-icon-expand" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="width:16px;height:16px;fill:currentColor;"&gt;&lt;path d="M7 14H5v5h5v-2H7v-3zm-2-4h2V7h3V5H5v5zm12 7h-3v2h5v-5h-2v3zM14 5v2h3v3h2V5h-5z"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
&lt;svg class="embed-icon-compress" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="width:16px;height:16px;fill:currentColor;display:none;"&gt;&lt;path d="M5 16h3v3h2v-5H5v2zm3-8H5v2h5V5H8v3zm6 11h2v-3h3v-2h-5v5zm2-11V5h-2v5h5V8h-3z"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
&lt;span class="embed-btn-text"&gt;全螢幕&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;iframe id="embed-iframe-18da448c1fc5fbac49d356be820ac974" src="https://wang-jian-an.github.io/slides-html/coding-basics/if/index.html" style="width: 100%; height: 600px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 8px;" loading="lazy" allowfullscreen&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;script&gt;
(function() {
if (window._embedFullscreenInit) return;
window._embedFullscreenInit = true;
window.toggleEmbedFullscreen = function(iframeId) {
var iframe = document.getElementById(iframeId);
if (!iframe) return;
if (!document.fullscreenElement) {
if (iframe.requestFullscreen) iframe.requestFullscreen();
else if (iframe.webkitRequestFullscreen) iframe.webkitRequestFullscreen();
else if (iframe.msRequestFullscreen) iframe.msRequestFullscreen();
} else {
if (document.exitFullscreen) document.exitFullscreen();
else if (document.webkitExitFullscreen) document.webkitExitFullscreen();
else if (document.msExitFullscreen) document.msExitFullscreen();
}
};
document.addEventListener('fullscreenchange', function() {
var containers = document.querySelectorAll('.embed-html-container');
containers.forEach(function(container) {
var expandIcon = container.querySelector('.embed-icon-expand');
var compressIcon = container.querySelector('.embed-icon-compress');
var btnText = container.querySelector('.embed-btn-text');
if (!expandIcon || !compressIcon || !btnText) return;
var iframe = container.querySelector('iframe');
if (document.fullscreenElement === iframe) {
expandIcon.style.display = 'none';
compressIcon.style.display = 'block';
btnText.textContent = '退出全螢幕';
} else {
expandIcon.style.display = 'block';
compressIcon.style.display = 'none';
btnText.textContent = '全螢幕';
}
});
});
})();
&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;h2 id="some-more-markdown-content"&gt;Some More Markdown Content&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As you can see, the embedded HTML page appears inline with the rest of the content. You can continue writing after it.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>